<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia housing backs economic pickup-govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia housing backs economic pickup-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday the improving housing sector was in line with the government's view of a strengthening economy in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The turning up in relation to the housing industry is consistent with a strengthening economy through 1997,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
</text>
